# packages/shared

This package is the contract. Change types here first, then web and api.

- `RoomSummary` / `RoomAccess` — HTTP rooms.
- `RuntimeEvent` / `RuntimeAction` — install/run console (`stdout` | `stderr` | `status` | `exit` | `error`).
- `Integrity*` — host snapshot and guest events. Paste meta may include `chars`, `lines`, `large`, `afterAway` — not the pasted text.

Keep types serializable over JSON/WebSocket. No React, no Node server imports.
